<p>Read this first. It is a complete, passing run of the sixteen-turn live scenario with <code>HOTEL_FLOW_CURRENT_DATE</code> frozen to <code>2027-07-15</code>. The run used the real OpenAI chat provider and TypeSafe Jev decision provider. Wording and confirmation numbers may vary; saved state, routing, grounded results, and completion are the durable contracts.</p>

<h2 id="run-it-yourself">Run it yourself</h2>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd pico-demo
npm run test:decision-hotel-flow</code></pre>
<p>The test sends every request through one session, semantically judges every response, and verifies the active step and final state. It is skipped unless <code>PICOFLOW_KEY</code>, <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code>, and <code>TYPESAFE_API_KEY</code> are available. A skipped test is not live evidence.</p>

